{"name": "Echo Generation 2", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"464\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/8fcb4fd85974a59e2f7d5a1e0976ecd2.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Echo Generation 2 </strong>is a turn-based sci-fi deckbuilding RPG from the creators of the award-winning Echo Generation (Best Indie Game, Best Narrative, Best Soundtrack).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Echo Generation 2, you step into the past as Jack, the father. What begins as a family vacation spirals into a mystery of hidden experiments, impossible realities, and the truth behind it all.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Six Playable Heroes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build your party from six distinct characters, each with their own abilities, decks, and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a party of three in the Championships, and discover how characters work together to unlock powerful synergies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"464\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f5b0b49f88233634ede439807330fd5.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f5b0b49f88233634ede439807330fd5.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f5b0b49f88233634ede439807330fd5.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Break the Enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a strategic stance system that rewards planning and timing. Match symbols to break enemy defenses, create openings, and unleash high-impact combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build Your Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your playstyle with deck choices, skill trees, and badge upgrades. Shape each hero to fit your approach and experiment with team compositions to overcome increasing threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"464\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f7a021bb8739732d69b58ca2490a771.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f7a021bb8739732d69b58ca2490a771.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/2f7a021bb8739732d69b58ca2490a771.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Multi-Perspective Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a character-driven narrative told across multiple perspectives.  Each chapter follows different heroes, with distinct tones and worlds, from noir horror to neon-lit cyberpunk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As these stories unfold, connections emerge, revealing a larger mystery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"464\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/35531876f9a0966af535ab096190d4be.poster.avif?t=1781537997\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/35531876f9a0966af535ab096190d4be.webm?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/extras/35531876f9a0966af535ab096190d4be.mp4?t=1781537997\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Retro 3D Pixel Aesthetic</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a richly detailed voxel world, crisp, colorful, and nostalgically crunchy, blending retro charm with modern visual polish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Turn Up the Synths</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cruise through the cosmos to an 80s-inspired analog synth soundtrack by Pusher, returning with an all-new interstellar score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Embark on a sci-fi deckbuilding RPG odyssey. Build your crew, master powerful decks, and uncover the truth behind a growing cosmic threat. Deal the cards. Defy the cosmos. Embrace the adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1115990/e34f76ee2c95a7d5b2d082003ca2973aa01c9906/header.jpg?t=1781537997", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Turn-Based Combat", "Action-Adventure", "JRPG", "Deckbuilding", "Fantasy", "Party-Based RPG"], "developers": "Cococucumber", "publishers": "Cococucumber", "release_date": "May 27, 2026", "price": "$24.99", "appid": "1115990", "re